# Clients (`apps/`)

## Shared rules

- **TypeScript strict** — no `any` without a comment and ticket/issue link.
- UI: **shadcn/ui + Radix**; dark mode day-one; use design tokens, not one-off hex in components.
- i18n: **i18next**; no hardcoded user-visible strings in components.
- Offline: **not offline-first** — show connection state; reconnect uses server sync (SDD §12.2), not a local message DB unless spec changes.

## Web (`apps/web`)

- Next.js App Router; keep server/client boundaries clear; secrets only on server.
- PWA is the iOS path — test safe areas and Web Push constraints.

## Desktop / mobile

- Electron wraps web; avoid duplicating chat logic — share packages under `apps/` or `packages/` when introduced.
- Android RN: FCM + native call hooks per SDD; sideload/APK flow, not store-assumed.

## API usage

- Call `/api/v1/` only; centralize fetch/WS client; handle 401 → refresh once, then logout.
